    LLM: 'Bidding: name a card you hold; holder of matching copy = secret partner. Overcall with lower card of same suit only. Can call card you hold both copies of = play alone. Play: no trumps, follow suit, highest of led suit wins, first of equal cards beats second. Card points: Figure V-VIIII=½pt, X=1pt; Matte XI-XV+Brescia=1pt each. Total 19pts.',
